s.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Is It <span class=\"italic\">Chop</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Shop</span>?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Ch</span> and <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> are unvoiced. When a sound is voiced it produces vibrations in the voice box. When a sound is unvoiced it is without using the voice box.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"CH Sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"SH Sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>eap\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">sh</span>eep\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lun<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scrump<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ti</span>ous(ti sounds like sh)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>ip\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">sh</span>ip\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>op\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">sh</span>op\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " Lun<span class=\"strong\">ch</span> was scrump<span class=\"strong\">ti</span>ous! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It certainly wasn't <span class=\"strong\">ch</span>eap either. Don't be so <span class=\"strong\">sh</span>eepi<span class=\"strong\">sh</span>! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Oh my God this <span class=\"strong\">sh</span>ip is sinking! Gosh, you really have a <span class=\"strong\">ch</span>ip on your shoulder! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It looks like someone <span class=\"strong\">ch</span>opped or sliced the pipe in half. We need to <span class=\"strong\">sh</span>op for a new one.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Intonation of Finished and Unfinished Ideas", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "If you raise intonation at the end of a sentence, it indicates that you have not completed your thoughts.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\"> Unfinished Thought</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">The kitchen sink has a cracked pipe. It looks like ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We also use rising intonation at the end of yes/no questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Have you finished all your laundry yet? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Let me see ...", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The kitchen sink has a cracked pipe. It looks like ...", "type": "example"}, {"content": "And someone left the water running while we were out. If it had been turned off before we ...", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scrumptious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a delicious taste", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Lunch was scrumptious!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about household problems.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sheepish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "bashful; embarrassed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't be so sheepish! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "astronomically", "type": "name"}, {"content": "enormously; immensely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was astronomically expensive!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hose", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a flexible and hollow tube that carries fluids", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They said if new hoses need to be put in, they will do that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hog", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use something and to stop others from using or having it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa was hogging it all morning!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "landlord", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who owns or rents apartments to people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The landlord needs to be called. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pipe", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a hollow tube made of metal or another strong and rigid material ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A new pipe needs to be put in.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a chip on one's shoulder", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bseem \u200bangry all the \u200btime because you \u200bthink you have been \u200btreated unfairly or \u200bfeel you are not as good as other \u200bpeople ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You really have a chip on your shoulder!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cracked", "type": "name"}, {"content": "damaged and showing lines on the surface", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The kitchen sink has a cracked pipe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob04aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a tongue twister with <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ch</span> sounds on the Internet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice saying it quickly five times in a row.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make you own tongue twister with <span class=\"italic\">ch</span> and <span class=\"italic\">sh</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice saying it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Get a friend to try it.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I say the sounds <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ch</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the sounds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a tongue twister with <span class=\"italic\">ch</span> and <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> sounds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the tongue twister.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to a friend say the tongue twister.", "type": "text"}]}]}